:StateOfAffairsContent rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual .


###  https://w3id.org/ontodesire#TMScanlon
:TMScanlon rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                    :Philosopher ;
           <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> "T. M. Scanlon" .


###  https://w3id.org/ontodesire#Teleofunctional
:Teleofunctional rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                          :MonofactorialTheory ;
                 :answersObjection :DoubleFaultObjection ;
                 :belongsToFamily :ActionBasedFamily ;
                 :defendedBy :DavidPapineau ,
                             :RuthMillikan ;
                 :identifiesDesireWith :ActionProductionFunction ;
                 :impliesCategory :BiologicalFunctionCategory ;
                 :suffersObjection :MotivatingGoodBeliefObjection ;
                 rdfs:label "teleofunctional action theory"@en ;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Desires are states whose function is to produce actions, whether or not they actually dispose the agent."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/ontodesire#TimothySchroeder
