                           :Philosopher ;
                  <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> "Timothy Schroeder" .


###  https://w3id.org/ontodesire#UnactionableDesiresObjection
:UnactionableDesiresObjection rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                       :Objection ;
                              rdfs:label "unactionable desires objection"@en ;
                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Too restrictive: desiring that pi be rational, or never to have been born, does not seem to exist in virtue of dispositions to act."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/ontodesire#UniversalWorldToMindFit
